Procedure – Experiment 12
1. Create a new Flutter project in VS Code.
2. Open lib/main.dart.
3. Import the Flutter Material package.
4. Create MaterialApp and Scaffold.
5. Add AppBar with the title "Placement Cell Portal".
6. Display the welcome heading using Text.
7. Add a button labelled "View Placement Details".
8. Use setState() to display placement details when clicked.
9. Use LayoutBuilder to display Mobile or Desktop Web Layout based on screen width.
10. Run using flutter run -d chrome and generate the web build using flutter build web.
